#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:177
msgid "K3b uses cdrecord to actually write CDs."
msgstr "K3b го користи cdrecord за снимањето на CD-а."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:178
msgid "Install the cdrtools package which contains cdrecord."
msgstr ""
"Инсталирајте го пакетот cdrtools што го содржи "
"cdrecord."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:185 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:257
#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:265 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:287
msgid "Used %1 version %2 is outdated"
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:186
msgid ""
"Although K3b supports all cdrtools versions since 1.10 it is highly recommended "
"to at least use version 2.0."
msgstr ""
"Иако K3b ги поддржува сите верзии на cdrtools по "
"1.10 препорачливо е да ја користите барем "
"верзијата 2.0."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:189
msgid "Install a more recent version of the cdrtools."
msgstr "Инсталирајте понова верзија на cdrtools."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:202
msgid "%1 will be run with root privileges on kernel >= 2.6.8"
msgstr ""
"%1 ќе биде извршуван со привилегии на root на "
"кернелите >= 2.6.8"

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:203
msgid ""
"Since Linux kernel 2.6.8 %1 will not work when run suid root for security "
"reasons anymore."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:205 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:218
#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:239
msgid "Use K3bSetup to solve this problem."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:210 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:235
msgid "%1 will be run without root privileges"
msgstr ""
"%1 ќе биде извршуван без привилегии на root"

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:211
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended to configure cdrecord to run with root privileges. "
"Only then cdrecord runs with high priority which increases the overall "
"stability of the burning process. Apart from that it allows changing the size "
"of the used burning buffer. A lot of user problems could be solved this way. "
"This is also true when using SuSE's resmgr."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:226
msgid "K3b uses cdrdao to actually write CDs."
msgstr "K3b го користи cdrdao за снимањето на CD-а."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:227
msgid "Install the cdrdao package."
msgstr "Инсталирајте го пакетот cdrdao."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:236
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended to configure cdrdao to run with root privileges to "
"increase the overall stability of the burning process."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:248
msgid ""
"K3b uses growisofs to actually write dvds. Without growisofs you won't be able "
"to write dvds. Make sure to install at least version 5.10."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:251 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:277
msgid "Install the dvd+rw-tools package."
msgstr "Инсталирајте го пакетот dvd+rw-tools."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:258
msgid ""
"K3b needs at least growisofs version 5.10 to write dvds. All older versions "
"will not work and K3b will refuse to use them."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:260 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:292
#, c-format
msgid "Install a more recent version of %1."
msgstr "Инсталирајте понова верзија на %1."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:266
msgid ""
"K3b won't be able to copy DVDs on-the-fly using a growisofs version older than "
"5.12."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:268
msgid "Install a more recent version of growisofs."
msgstr "Инсталирајте понова верзија на growisofs."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:276
msgid "K3b uses dvd+rw-format to format DVD-RWs and DVD+RWs."
msgstr ""
"K3b го користи dvd+rw-format за да форматира DVD-RW-а и "
"DVD+RW-а."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:290
msgid ""
"K3b needs at least mkisofs version 1.14. Older versions may introduce problems "
"when creating data projects."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:318
msgid "No ATAPI writing support in kernel"
msgstr ""
"Во кернелот нема поддршка за запишување "
"преку ATAPI"

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:319
msgid ""
"Your kernel does not support writing without SCSI emulation but there is at "
"least one writer in your system not configured to use SCSI emulation."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:323
msgid ""
"The best and recommended solution is to enable ide-scsi (SCSI emulation) for "
"all devices. This way you won't have any problems.Be aware that you may still "
"enable DMA on ide-scsi emulated drives."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:340 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:359
msgid "%1 %2 does not support ATAPI"
msgstr "%1 %2 не поддржува ATAPI"

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:341 k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:361
msgid ""
"The configured version of %1 does not support writing to ATAPI devices without "
"SCSI emulation and there is at least one writer in your system not configured "
"to use SCSI emulation."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:346
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The best and recommended solution is to enable ide-scsi (SCSI emulation) for "
"all devices. This way you won't have any problems. Or you install (or select as "
"the default) a more recent version of %1."
msgstr ""

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:367
msgid ""
"Install cdrdao >= 1.1.8 which supports writing to ATAPI devices directly."
msgstr ""
"Инсталирајте го cdrdao >= 1.1.8 кое што поддржува "
"директно запишување на ATAPI-уреди."

#: k3bsystemproblemdialog.cpp:369
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The best, and recommended, solution is to use ide-scsi (SCSI emulation) for all "
"writer devices: this way you will not have any problems; or, you can install "
"(or select as the default) a more recent version of %1."
msgstr ""

