"will be hidden on the ISO9660 and RockRidge filesystem.</p><p>"
"This is useful, for example, for having different README files for RockRidge "
"and Joliet, which can be managed by hiding README.joliet on RockRidge and "
"README.rr on the Joliet filesystem.</p>"
